{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0543_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d997e809d3fd0b6727b3800652c0a1bd6854c248fd48f4f1a29b34a06e7030a5", "ja": "（『階のスターエレメンツ』スペシャル版の好評を\n受けて、トークイベントが開かれる事になった）", "zh": "（由于《阶梯的明星元素》特别版广受好评，决定举办一场谈话活动。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0543_1001_p", "source_sha256": "58b7e49cef623475fb05acd2c713f5b166aa54a8ef88d1f478d47a15c62e6e02", "ja": "（未来と可奈は別件で遅れてくるけど、\n琴葉はもう来ているはず……）", "zh": "（未来和可奈因为其他事情会晚点到，不过琴叶应该已经到了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0543_1002_017kth", "source_sha256": "a8b71fe1b26b1da20be20ea1433231c64e13e0b9a1a97a86968c6734adacebff", "ja": "……うーん……。\nやっぱり、硬い気がする……。", "zh": "……唔……\n还是觉得有点僵硬……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0543_1003_p", "source_sha256": "3e8cd93b74d55f220abb40089abe51ec29bb9b592b192445756b46ce24cfb14f", "ja": "琴葉、お疲れ様！\n……琴葉？", "zh": "琴叶，辛苦了！\n……琴叶？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0543_1004_p", "source_sha256": "4e3396f01a2e934e64d897b5bdb91c05819cdb3fc24e3d6d199c2139a734e4a8", "ja": "（なんだか真剣に鏡を見ているけど……\nもしかして、笑顔の練習をしてる？）", "zh": "（她好像正认真地照着镜子……难道是在练习笑容？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0543_1005_se", "source_sha256": "d8c4aa48b2536964b1b8a51c087d5ff6f372854d34d55e9f849432c96da249d4", "ja": "ピピピピピ……", "zh": "哔哔哔哔哔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0543_1006_p", "source_sha256": "06d476c94cc6bd7c6b9cc8ee7e10f0eaf61049171c24c99af3e30e6eab3791a2", "ja": "わ！？\nな、なんだ、スマホか……。", "zh": "哇！？\n什、什么啊，是手机吗……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0543_1007_017kth", "source_sha256": "79904482efc1d2224c8f102411680107579bc0219c4c4dea02b3a8e704805b6b", "ja": "えっ！？　あっ、{$P$}！？", "zh": "咦！？啊，{$P$}！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0543_1008_p", "source_sha256": "319763f2a7728c9bd327da8c5a9c60580aaa1055bb6165207aa83c913de90b40", "ja": "あっ、ごめん！　覗いてたわけじゃなくて、その、\n一応声は掛けたんだけど……。", "zh": "啊，抱歉！我不是故意偷看的，只是那个，\n其实我有先出声叫你……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0543_1009_017kth", "source_sha256": "b41e3930f7cc191b532437c197df36acb954640793d34191e5823fc64cf21240", "ja": "そ、そうだったんですね。見られていたのは、\n恥ずかしいですけど……困ることではないので。", "zh": "原、原来是这样啊。虽然被看到了有点害羞……但也不是什么为难的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0543_1010_017kth", "source_sha256": "fdd41e3f7cb8f31586ba8b4f165bbc4df6212dd4632471cc1bfe819d04b4c423", "ja": "実は、表情のストレッチをしてたんです。", "zh": "其实，我刚才是在做表情拉伸。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0543_1011_p", "source_sha256": "1d8eb0c62f8236ac9b4e716678203e5925ea8ede35c671e4bc9f4b100336122f", "ja": "そうみたいだな……。\nいつもやってるのか？", "zh": "看起来是这样……你平时也会做吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0543_1012_017kth", "source_sha256": "c491701bc405615a99b0a54a4cd860cd55f77ff5e08be032091a716a5b342201", "ja": "いいえ。その、今回の撮影期間中、学校の友達に\n「顔が怖い」って言われることが多かったんです。", "zh": "不是。那个，这次拍摄期间，学校里的朋友们经常说我“表情很吓人”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0543_1013_p", "source_sha256": "3b7607ef8a5a4991a8adae616017d4e345060a1eba332c436e8f280757b53057", "ja": "えっ、そうなのか？", "zh": "咦，是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0543_1014_017kth", "source_sha256": "bdd3ac17f2dff64a73e4d2d61cdabcb945515b4811ce4ca43e10c0619a6390de", "ja": "はい。あとは、歩くのが速いとか。\n普段よりも、更に背筋が伸びているとか……。", "zh": "是的。还有就是走路比平时快，或者……背比平时挺得更直。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0543_1015_017kth", "source_sha256": "81303df20ad7ad2b062fa49d540f845a02317339bd599eb61c5dc10383cd4c48", "ja": "自分では気が付いてなかったんですけど、\n無意識のうちに、星蘭に引っ張られていたみたいで。", "zh": "我自己都没有察觉到，原来在不知不觉间，似乎被星兰影响了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0543_1016_017kth", "source_sha256": "d685bc2ed4bc290760f2c478409eace7044fd250f785e40ed6d68b97e6bad770", "ja": "実は、前回の『階のスターエレメンツ』の\n撮影中も、同じことを言われて……それで。", "zh": "其实，上次拍《阶梯的StarElements》的时候，\n我也被说过一样的话……所以才会这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0543_1017_p", "source_sha256": "ae8d19e4c428f956a92da347a2acc7de0f09397141829a150d3935f972ef4892", "ja": "なるほど。役作りが、\n日常生活にも影響しちゃってたんだな……。", "zh": "原来如此。看来为了塑造角色，连日常生活都受到了影响啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0543_1018_017kth", "source_sha256": "e252319796658dcda1513e46326c39bfd3bbe447b211fe0f7467e9a0e7e1e7eb", "ja": "でも、今日はトークイベントですし。新しい\nお客さんもいるだろうから、注意しなくちゃと思って。", "zh": "不过，今天可是谈话活动。应该也会有新来的客人，所以得注意一下才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0543_1019_017kth", "source_sha256": "92405f26b5efc3b10a296dddbd8b9a7bd5358fc2c0baec3cf488973c00b02884", "ja": "それで、笑顔を作る練習を……すみません。", "zh": "所以我才练习怎么露出笑容……对不起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0543_1020_p", "source_sha256": "00242de2fdb874217800a756d6d67d9a3b3831efcaa7033ac722f46798098d0a", "ja": "謝るような事じゃないよ。\n心配しなくても、いつもどおりの琴葉で大丈夫だ。", "zh": "没什么好道歉的。不用担心，做平时的琴叶就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0543_1021_017kth", "source_sha256": "24adf7772ab4c181de6e4f4da0b3ba0271a7ab3836b6b3238a6371092703dd98", "ja": "そうだといいんですけど……あっ。それより\n{$P$}、スマホ鳴ってましたよね？", "zh": "要是那样就好了……啊。比起这个，{$P$}，刚才你的手机响了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0543_1022_p", "source_sha256": "5d66d4c61b32b5518006d3c6e03f8fcdb48a509f16eb2475b5e7a9c8cb668f9f", "ja": "おっと、そういえばそうだった。えーと……\n未来からだ。可奈と一緒に、もうすぐ着くって。", "zh": "哎呀，说起来确实是这样。呃……是未来打来的。她说和可奈一起，马上就到了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0543_1023_017kth", "source_sha256": "78042591df6feffd688bdb65b4019e14230afd96dd64cd062dedc08fd080b0b7", "ja": "本当ですか？　良かった。\nひとりだと、やっぱり少し心細かったので……。", "zh": "真的吗？那太好了。\n因为只有我一个人的话，果然还是有点不安……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0543_1024_017kth", "source_sha256": "4947df2171ae86521d9922430145c611600f9ce4b084e7dc7cc1225c45047aea", "ja": "ファンの人達も、3人のほうが絶対に嬉しいですよね。\nふたりとも、早く来ないかな……♪", "zh": "粉丝们也肯定会觉得有3人更开心吧。  \n他们两个也不知道能不能早点来……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0543_1025_p", "source_sha256": "a4eab27a8b8bcfe88b3ce328440a78a01cd4a1783d48a345bbb979912e28524b", "ja": "（そう言った琴葉は、優しい笑顔をしていた。\n……この調子なら、何も心配しなくて良さそうだ！）", "zh": "（说出这番话的琴叶，脸上带着温柔的笑容。\n……照这个情况来看，应该不用担心什么了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
